            <ArticleTitle>Report of an adverse incident in a randomized clinical trial.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>203-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This is a case report of a child who experienced a possible adverse reaction to paracetamol, in a randomized clinical trial comparing paracetamol with ibuprofen for control of orthodontic pain. Through this case report we highlight the importance of formulating a protocol for management of adverse events when designing a randomized clinical trial.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
